# Bobby charging (Nova + phone)

Wrong apartment = real money. Never type or send a NovaSys or overseas password.

## Who works

- Laptop `watch_open.py` refreshes Open every ~60s. No AI on empty ticks. During Nova Pay the phone stays on that RU (wake + Request Detail). Before SET PIN, reopen the RU if the phone left it.
- **Auto Pay:** on a new chargeable RU the laptop opens it, fills Create payment, and **Pays only if apartment + T1/T2 + amount match**. Then attach + SET PIN + Ok. Do not wait for this chat to say Pay. Wake this chat after success or fail (dashboard). Hard RUs also wake this chat. Recheck Bot Off and the boxes immediately before Pay.
- **Website Bot Off = everything off.** No Home → Requests, no PLANB, no Pay, no SET PIN. This chat stops. Same as **Bobby stop watching**. If the switch cannot be read, treat as Off.
- One RU at a time, **oldest first**. Finish it (Pay + attach + SET PIN + Ok, **or** cannot_charge + Back) before the next.
- **Watch waits.** Do not open the next RU, do not run PLANB, while **Invoice** or **Create payment** is open, or while SET PIN on the current RU is not finished. Two jobs on one phone is how the wrong paper gets attached.
- Other tabs (HR / Sheets) do not touch ADB or Nova.
- Spoken “close” = **SET PIN** only. Never tap **Close request**. After success, tap **Ok** only.

## Phone

- App `com.abacuscambridge.empireworldErbil`. Refresh = Home → Requests **only when the main Staff bar is showing** (Home / Requests / Tasks / Account).
- After **grey / red X / cannot_charge / any fail**: **Back (Navigate up)** off Request Detail / Items **before** the next refresh. Fail does not SET PIN, so the phone stays on that RU until we leave it.
- Request Detail / Items use their own bottom tabs. Home `(134,2144)` and Requests `(405,2144)` hit those tabs and **never** reach the Open list. That is why `open=0` can be a lie.
- A dump with `Request ID` / `SET PIN` / `Request Detail` and **no** `Buy - RU-` is **not** an empty Open list. Back first, then Home → Requests, then read cards. Grey skips **that RU only**; other Open RUs still get done.
- Do not spam Back from Home — that opens **Exit Application**. Tap **NO** if it appears.
- **RU-#####** is unique. Charge once per RU.
- Items: **IQD before the dot, no comma.** Ignore **Qty**. Ignore **FM-…**. Ignore a 50 K header if the line IQD is different. Example: Qty 2 + `IQD 100000.0` → Pay **100000**.
- **Nova only:** National → **T1**. Generator → **T2**. **Overseas:** National or Generator does not matter — still charge that RU.
- Attachments = **Invoice paper photo only**. Nova = Invoice window (not the payments grid). Overseas = the white Invoice slip only (not the Edge screen). Remarks empty. PIN always `Charged`.
- Attach file name is **`invoice-RU-######.jpg`** (the request **RU**, not the apartment / Customer Name). Same name for Nova and overseas. Push that new file, pick **only that name** in Gallery. Never tap a leftover `IMG_…` or an old `invoice-WW-…` / `invoice-ES-…` / `invoice-WD-…`.
- Before SET PIN, the paper on the request must show this RU’s **apartment + amount**. Nova also 156 vs 480. If it does not match, stop — do not SET PIN.

## Nova vs overseas

- **Nova:** `ES-` and `WW-12` … `WW-15`. Search as the phone except ES4 `ES-4-17-02` → `ES4-17-2` and ES6 `ES-6-{floor}-{apt}` (floors 2–24, apts 1–6).
- **Overseas (live):** `RV-`, `RA-`, `WD-`, `WW-1` … `WW-11`. STS Vending. Oldest first across Nova **and** overseas, one RU at a time. Customer Selector **none or more than one row** → skip that RU (dashboard `no_row` / `ambiguous`), next RU. Save charged and skipped overseas rows on Charging Electricity with **source `overseas`**. Dashboard shows **Nova** or **Overseas**. No National/Generator.
- Keep-awake may still click **Home** every 4 minutes so Edge stays logged in. Login page → **Sign In** only (saved password). Never type the password. That is not charging.
- **Nova only:** Charge only if first column is **green circle + white tick**. Ignore orange/red **row fill**. Grey clock (**pending**): click **Refresh** once (toolbar next to Pay, or F5), then look again. If it is green, Pay as usual. If it is still pending after that one refresh, no Pay, no SET PIN; save dashboard; leave that request; keep watching. Red X = no refresh, no Pay; save dashboard and leave. Trust the search screenshot if pixels say pending.

## Overseas process (locked)

Site: Edge **Overseas Integration Platform** (`empire.pswla.com`). First screen after login = Home Page.

1. Quick Operations: **STS Vending** only. Never **Re-print Invoice**.
2. Do not click or type the Customer Name box. Click the **search icon next to that box**.
3. Customer Selector: type the Unit ID **exactly as the phone** in the empty box (example `ww-11-11-a`). Click the **search icon next to that typed Unit ID**, not the first search icon.
4. **One click** = highlight only. **Double click** the result row to open it.
5. Amount starts `0.00` — delete the zeros, **type** the phone IQD. Do not click `50000` / `100000` / `150000` / `200000`.
6. **Recharge** only. Never **Pay Arrears Only**. Confirm **Are you sure you want to pay for that?** → **Ok**. `.00` on the amount is fine.
7. Invoice **PDF** page opens (narrow Invoice paper, not Nova Payment Receipt). Save **only the white Invoice slip** as **`invoice-RU-######.jpg`** (the RU, not the unit) — not the Edge window, Acrobat toolbar, or grey PDF background. Push to the phone. Gallery: pick **only that name**. Then SET PIN.
8. Close the Invoice PDF **Edge tab** (`rechargePrint`, Ctrl+W) so the watch is not stuck. Then **Recharge successfully!** → **Ok**. Leftover Customer Name is that unit — do not recharge again. **X** on the STS Vending tab → Home Page.
9. Inside STS Vending, do search + amount + Recharge without sitting still. If a tab jumps while about to type the Unit ID, start STS Vending again (only if it happened).
10. No National / Generator on this site. Phone National or Generator still gets charged the same way.

## Pay

- Tariff is a **dropdown only**. Never type T1/T2. Nova often opens on T2.
- Before Pay, the Create payment boxes must show the same **apartment + T1/T2 + amount**. Else stop.
- T1 = 156 IQD/kWh. T2 = 480 IQD/kWh.
- Login: if user **swar** and password **empty** → **Cancel**, then **close Nova** and **open Nova** again. When **Attention!** “data base version is obsolete” appears → **Yes**. Never type the password. Never OK the empty login. Never OK the “Logging in” box.
- Charged dashboard rows need an invoice URL. Waiting rows need a note. Unique on `ru`. Set `started_at` when the RU starts.

## Commands

- **Bobby stop watching** → stop the laptop watch (no Home → Requests, no Pay, no SET PIN).
- **Start watching Bobby** → start `watch_loop.ps1` (exits when the website Bot is Off). Nova and overseas.
- **bobby start overseas too** → already live. Charge overseas RUs with the locked STS Vending process.
- Website **Turn Off** → laptop watch exits; overseas keep exits; Pay / SET PIN / PLANB refuse to run; this chat does not continue a charge.
